igin → internal ALB in the edge subnets, which only CloudFront may reach (security group on the CloudFront origin-facing prefix list); the ALB targets Envoy's pods directly (target group svp-stg-envoy, filled by the TargetGroupBinding), Envoy routes by Host to web and gateway · Media: CloudFront → S3 media through origin access control, flat-rate Free plan, no access log · Route 53 aliases to the three distributions · access logs of web and API (media has none) and logs of the three web ACLs go to the log archive account" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#5A6C86;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="280" width="1640" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s3ep" value="S3 gateway endpoint" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#8C4FFF;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;pointerEvents=1;shape=mxgraph.aws4.endpoints;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2520" y="1520" width="80" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="gdep" value="GuardDuty interface endpoint&lt;br&gt;guardduty-data, 443 from the VPC" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#8C4FFF;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;pointerEvents=1;shape=mxgraph.aws4.endpoints;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2800" y="1520" width="80" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="waflogs" value="S3 aws-waf-logs-svp&lt;br&gt;logs of the three web ACLs, us-east-1" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=#60A337;gradientDirection=north;fillColor=#277116;strokeColor=#