CloudWatch Logs&lt;br&gt;/svp/stg/otel, aws/spans" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=#F54749;gradientDirection=north;fillColor=#C7131F;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.cloudwatch_2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1760" y="2160" width="80" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="xray" value="X-Ray&lt;br&gt;Transaction Search" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=#F54749;gradientDirection=north;fillColor=#C7131F;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.xray;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2040" y="2160" width="80" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t_65" value='&lt;ul style="margin:0;padding-left:16px"&gt;&lt;li&gt;ECR, AMP, the application log group and the X-Ray settings are in the root of the account, so they outlive the session; keys alias/svp-stg-ecr and alias/svp-stg-observability&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;AMG svp-stg and its grafana-workspace-id parameter exist only between session open and close (session_open)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Collector and Prometheus agent write to AMP, CloudWatch Logs and X-Ray; nodes pull images from ECR, third-party images through its pull-through cache&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Interface endpoints: private DNS, 443 from the VPC, ENIs in the private subnets of the first 1 AZ(s); GitHub, Sigstore, Telegram, upstream registries, the Pricing API and AMG still go through NAT&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;' style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2320" y="2160" width="1160" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="acm" value="ACM · ALB certificate, ap-southeast-1&lt;br&gt;viewer certificates in us-east-1" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=#F54749;gradientDirection=north;fillColor=#C7131F;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.certificate_manager_2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2960" y="1720" width="80" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mcrole" value="Role svp-stg-mediaconvert&lt;br&gt;GetObject uploads/*, PutObject media/*" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#C7131F;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;pointerEvents=1;shape=mxgraph.aws4.role;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="1960" width="80" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mc" value="MediaConvert queue svp-stg&lt;br&gt;on-demand" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=#F78E04;gradientDirection=north;fillColor=#D05C17;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.elemental_mediaconvert;" vert